00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:06.300
And I'm so excited because I
have so much fun on that show,

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.200
and it's such a fantasy to be
able to sing with them

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.033
and out-sing them.
Let's be honest.

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:12.968
-Yeah, you're the best.
Of all of them, you're the best.

00:02:12.968 --> 00:02:16.167
You know, you're living a lot of
your best life right now.

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.701
You have a big birthday
coming up April 15th.

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:20.868
This is a big one.
-Tax day.

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:23.334
-Yeah.
-People are not distracted

00:02:23.334 --> 00:02:25.801
