00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:32.200
I have two old horses and I have
five dogs and two cats.

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.200
-Here's a photo of your five
dogs, who are very nicely posed.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.367
-Those are our pack.

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:37.968
-Good pack.

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:40.734
-And these two are new,

00:03:40.734 --> 00:03:44.834
and we lost a -- our little
alpha Chihuahua,

00:03:44.834 --> 00:03:47.067
who ran the household,
at Christmas.

00:03:47.067 --> 00:03:49.367
So, of course,
I'm like devastated.

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:52.601
Janine's devastated, my wife,
and we're just like,

00:03:52.601 --> 00:03:54.367
"We can't even bear it --"
and everything.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:56.701
And then at night, like porn,
I'm looking on Petfinder,

00:03:56.701 --> 00:03:59.734
and I'm like, "What about these
two 16-year-olds?"

00:03:59.734 --> 00:04:01.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.234 --> 00:04:04.968
Because my dream is to, like,
adopt very old dogs.

00:04:04.968 --> 00:04:07.300
We've always done it,
and then you think it's going to

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:10.334
be like -- you think it's going
to be like Aunt Queenie

00:04:10.334 --> 00:04:13.033
that's going to live there
until she dies in six weeks,

00:04:13.033 --> 00:04:15.200
