there for 10 years.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.534 --> 00:04:18.601
-So you think a dog has sort of
a whole second wind?

00:04:18.601 --> 00:04:21.434
-Oh, my God. You give them
a happy life, and they're just

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:23.734
