has already passed.

00:04:29.901 --> 00:04:33.067
Should we adopt this one?"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:37.167
But we have -- we've created
this, like, dream life

00:04:37.167 --> 00:04:38.901
